## Build and test

```
mvn -B verify          # needs Docker for the Testcontainers PostgreSQL tests
```

## Run locally

```
mvn spring-boot:test-run     # starts the app with a throw-away PostgreSQL container (see src/test/.../TestApplication.java)
```

For a real environment set `DB_URL`, `DB_USERNAME`, `DB_PASSWORD` and `OIDC_ISSUER_URI` as environment variables (from your secret manager). Nothing secret is stored in this repository.

## Layout

| Package | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `api` | REST controllers: HTTP in and out, no business rules, no repositories |
| `dto` | Request and response records; entities never cross this boundary |
| `service` | Business rules and transactions |
| `domain` | JPA entities, enums and converters |
| `repository` | Spring Data repositories |
| `config` | Security, auditing, error handling |
